  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Hakili Matagi - Immigration Support 2019 - 23</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Hakili Matagi&lt;/em&gt; is a&#xA0;five year programme 2019-2023 delivered by Immigration NZ, that provides&#xA0;a comprehensive programme of bilateral&#xA0;support in Niue, Tokelau, the Cook Islands, Tonga, Fiji, Samoa and Kiribati.&#xA0;This includes capacity development in immigration legislation and policy, intelligence gathering and compliance, data capture and analysis, profiling and risk assessments, operationalising joint border activities, and organisational management and professional development.&lt;/span&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
